function sanitizeTreeData(){const tr=appData.tree;if(!tr)return;const totalPomos=(appData.records||[]).reduce(function(s,r){return s+getPomos(r);},0);const legitCeil=totalPomos*10+2000;const recovered=Math.min(totalPomos,legitCeil);let dirty=false;if(typeof tr.points==='number'&&tr.points>legitCeil){tr.points=recovered;dirty=true;}
if(typeof tr.peakPoints==='number'&&tr.peakPoints>legitCeil){tr.peakPoints=Math.max(tr.points||0,recovered);dirty=true;}
if(tr.speciesPoints&&typeof tr.speciesPoints==='object'){Object.keys(tr.speciesPoints).forEach(function(k){if(typeof tr.speciesPoints[k]==='number'&&tr.speciesPoints[k]>legitCeil){tr.speciesPoints[k]=recovered;dirty=true;}});}
if(dirty)saveDataNow();}
